WEBVTT

00:16:30.371 --> 00:16:34.787
For many people, morning routines often
include a good cup of coffee and for

00:16:34.787 --> 00:16:38.037
the team members at Morgan Stanley's
global headquarters in Times Square,

00:16:38.371 --> 00:16:40.371
the coffee comes with a special pairing.

00:16:40.746 --> 00:16:44.871
We stick together and be kind to
each other, love each other,

00:16:45.121 --> 00:16:49.287
respect each other, and everything
is going to be fine.

00:16:49.329 --> 00:16:51.662
Do you meet Edith and Angela?

00:16:51.704 --> 00:16:55.037
They run a coffee cart together in the
heart of New York City. I met my

00:16:55.037 --> 00:17:02.912
wife in Brownsville, Texas, too many years
ago, a long time ago, 1975, 75 75.